_vrf_PLAT973_u84-y               
;
PROBLEM: Check Calcd Positive Resid. Density on U3D 5.59 eA-3
RESPONSE: Due to the uranium atom, common for heavy atoms to 
have high residual q-peaks that are very close.
;
_vrf_PLAT220_u84-y               
;
PROBLEM: NonSolvent Resd 1 O Ueq(max) / Ueq(min) Range 10.0 Ratio
RESPONSE: Due to positional/site occupancy disorder of oxygen atoms 
on the sulfates, coordinating water, and solvated waters. 
Please see SI for more information.
;
_vrf_PLAT241_u84-y               
;
PROBLEM: High MainMol Ueq as Compared to Neighbors of O88 Check
RESPONSE: Due to positional/site occupancy disorder of oxygen atoms 
on the sulfates, coordinating water, and solvated waters. 
Please see SI for more information.
;
_vrf_PLAT306_u84-y               
